1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,140
Listen to an announcement on a campus radio station.

2
00:00:03,140 --> 00:00:06,594
Man: Due to some recent changes in university policy,

3
00:00:06,594 --> 00:00:11,200
we need everyone to update their contact information in the student portal.

4
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:15,661
Doing so will ensure that you receive important notifications,

5
00:00:15,661 --> 00:00:19,130
including about class cancellations and emergency alerts.

6
00:00:19,130 --> 00:00:22,190
Please complete the update by the end of this week.

7
00:00:22,190 --> 00:00:25,270
Don't take a chance on missing out on critical information.
